     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recognising an informal email",
     "texto": [
      "**Kære** and **Hej** can open an email; **Knus** is a close sign-off. Notice who is writing and what they ask before interpreting an isolated sentence.",
      "**Tak for sidst** refers to a recent shared occasion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Interpreting trends",
     "texto": [
      "**Stiger** (rises), **falder** (falls) and **er stort set uændret** (stays practically the same) describe different changes. Before summarising, identify which variable is measured and over what period.",
      "**Alt i alt viser tallene, at …** introduces a general conclusion, which must match the data."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
